 "remarks": "Experience the very best of coastal living in this beautifully renovated, sophisticated 4-bedroom, 3.5-bath waterfront retreat, offering breathtaking views of Long Island Sound and the Long Island shoreline. Ideally situated directly across from the beach in Rowayton's coveted private Pine Point Association, this exceptional home combines timeless nautical charm with modern luxury.  Thoughtfully updated throughout, the home features exquisite finishes, impeccable attention to detail, and a refined coastal aesthetic that complements its spectacular setting. Expansive water views take center stage in every season, while a dedicated home office overlooking the Sound makes working from home a pleasure.  Enjoy effortless indoor-outdoor living on the spacious patio, perfect for entertaining, soaking up the sun, or simply taking in the ever-changing waterfront scenery. Mature landscaping creates inviting pockets of privacy for relaxed afternoons and intimate alfresco dining. A private guest or in-law suite, complete with its own bath and sitting area, offers additional comfort and flexibility for family and visitors.  Whether enjoying summer days at the beach, crisp fall mornings overlooking the water, or the peaceful beauty of the Sound in winter, this extraordinary home offers a rare opportunity to experience luxury seaside living in one of Rowayton's most desirable coastal communities.  NOT AVAILABLE MID JULY-MID AUGUST even if annual rental.",
